# Backend evidence — agent trust/policy/ask (P3) + governed resilience (P4), ADR 0023

Scope: `crates/kernel-core`, `crates/a2a`, `crates/api`, `crates/storage`,
`crates/daemon`. Full detail and rationale in `docs/adr/0023-agent-trust-
policy-resilience.md` — this log is the run/build/test transcript.

## Files changed (one-line why each)

- `crates/kernel-core/src/delegation_gate.rs` (new) — the `DelegationGate`
  seam (`DelegationDecisionOutcome`, `DelegationRequestMeta`,
