  wiring, mirroring the skill-activation journal entries field-for-field.
- `crates/kernel-core/src/engine.rs` — `RunStatus::
  AwaitingDelegationDecision`, `Run.pending_delegation`, `PendingDelegation`,
  `RunEvent::AgentDelegationRequested/Decided` (with a `branch:
  Option<String>` field for forward-compat with a future plan-mode pause),
  `ResilienceConfig`, `Kernel.delegation_gate` + `with_delegation_gate`,
  `still_awaiting_delegation_decision` + the top-of-`execute_run_inner`
