- `crates/kernel-core/src/store.rs`, `crates/storage/src/lib.rs` —
  `unfinished_runs()` positive allowlist gains
  `RunStatus::AwaitingDelegationDecision` (SQL `IN (...)` + in-memory
  filter) — the same load-bearing fix ADR 0021 needed, re-applied here.
  Plus `pending_delegation: None` added to every `Run` literal across the
  crate's tests and `apps/desktop/src-tauri/tests/durable_store.rs`.
- `crates/kernel-core/src/lib.rs` — new module + re-exports
  (`delegation_gate`, `CircuitCheck`, `PendingDelegation`,
  `ResilienceConfig`, `PendingDelegationFold`, etc.).
- `crates/a2a/src/registry.rs` (new) — `AgentRegistry`/`AgentManifest`,
